":"YugabyteDB core features"},{"id":1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"},{"id":6011843911,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBlCVUc8AAAABZlV1Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/2.20%20Backport%20Required","name":"2.20 Backport Required","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"basavaraj29","id":17742021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQyMDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17742021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29","html_url":"https://github.com/basavaraj29","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"basavaraj29","id":17742021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQyMDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17742021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29","html_url":"https://github.com/basavaraj29","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2023-11-07T06:00:13Z","updated_at":"2023-11-27T17:06:29Z","closed_at":"2023-11-27T17:06:29Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-8808](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-8808)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nThread T1 - peer shutdown\r\n`TabletPeer::StartShutdown()` ends up calling `WaitQueue::Impl::StartShutdown` while holding tablet peer's `lock_`. The latter ends up executing `thread_pool_token_->Shutdown()`, which waits for the last running task to finish.\r\n\r\nThread T2 - thread processing `TriggerPoll` tasks off `thread_pool_token_`.\r\nAssume this thread is already running and is about to resume a waiter with `Status::OK()` (this would be the last task). when invoking the write query's callback, the thread calls `CreateOperationDriver` while preparing the write for replication, which in turn calls `GetRaftConsensusUnsafe()`, where we end up waiting for the tablet peer's `lock_`\r\n\r\nSo this leads to a deadlock, where T1 acquires `lock_` and waits for the last task in the threadpool to finish. While T2 processing the last task in the threadpool waits for peer's `lock_`.\r\n\r\ncc: @robertsami \r\n\r\nOne possible solution is to refactor Wait-Queue shutdown path. `StartShutdown` should only set shutdown flags, and all callbacks should be executed as part of `CompleteShutdown`, which doesn't hold the peer's `lock_`\r\n\r\n### Issue Type\r\n\r\nkind/bug\r\n\r\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\r\n\r\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\r\n\r\n[DB-8808]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-8808?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"basavaraj29","id":17742021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQyMDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17742021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29","html_url":"https://github.com/basavaraj29","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/19867/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/19867/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}